 ],
 "literal": "Curved-thorned mundaka plant's sharp-dewy dark flowers, / like pearls severed from a thread, by the wind being scattered, / on every shore spreading on the pure sand, the lord of such a coast, / I too am in love with him, my mother too is very desirous of him, / my father too desires to give me in marriage to him, / and the gossiping town too speaks of none but him!",
 "translation": "The sharp, dewy, dark flowers of the curved-thorned mundaka plant are scattered by the wind like pearls broken from their thread, spreading across the pure sand of every shore. I am in love with the lord of that coast. My mother too is very fond of him, and my father too wishes to give me to him in marriage. Even this gossiping town speaks only of him!",
 "modern": "வளைந்த முட்களைக் கொண்ட முண்டகச் செடியின் கூர்மையான, பனி பொருந்திய கரிய மலர்கள், நூல் அறுந்த முத்துக்களைப் போலக் காற்றினால் சிதறி, கடற்கரையின் தூய மணல் பரப்பிலெல்லாம் பரவிக் கிடக்கும். அத்தகைய நெய்தல் நிலத் தலைவனை நானும் காதலிக்கிறேன். என் தாயும் அவனை மிகவும் விரும்புகிறாள். என் தந்தையும் என்னை அவனுக்கே மணம் முடித்துக் கொடுக்க விரும்புகிறார். இந்த அலர் தூற்றும் ஊரும் அவனையே என்னோடு சேர்த்துப் பேசுகிறது.",
 "explanation": "The friend is speaking to the heroine, expressing her joy that the secret love affair is now moving smoothly toward a public marriage. She notes that not only does the heroine love the lord of the coast, but her mother is also very fond of him, her father wishes to give her in marriage, and even the gossiping town is linking their names. The opening image describes the dark flowers of the curved-thorned mundaka plant being scattered by the wind like pearls broken from a thread, spreading over the white sands. This represents the secret love which was once hidden but has now been scattered and made public through the town's gossip. However, instead of causing harm, this public exposure has led to the parents' consent, turning a potentially painful situation into a beautiful union, just as the scattered dark flowers beautify the white sand.",
